OL,3,AJensen Huang: Silicon Valley superstar
OL,4,Aengulfed by personal scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 63-year-old who was once lauded as
OL,7,Fthe "Taylor Swift of tech" and referred
OL,8,Fto as "Daddy Huang" in Taiwan is now
OL,9,Fmired in scandal after an affair with a
OL,10,Fsuspected Chinese spy.
